This library adapts LT8912B initialization and register programming from
Espressif's esp_lcd_lt8912b component in esp-bsp:
https://github.com/espressif/esp-bsp/tree/master/components/lcd/esp_lcd_lt8912b

and from Adafruit's Arduino driver:
https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit_LT8912B

